; --- breaker batch 237: run-length 3-tuple state, negative digit-peel (truncated div/rem), parity-alternating two-effect draws ---
(case
  "rle1 RUN-LENGTH tracking — the 3-tuple state carries (last,run,best); the n=5 seed extends one run to five, n=7 breaks it at two"
  (input
